  "mappingSource": "catalog vkb.json: EDCD community map 231D012C \"VKB STECS Regular Throttle System Mini Plus (Left)\" (https://github.com/EDCD/EliteCustomButtonNames/blob/main/files/INTO%20Bindings/DeviceButtonMaps/231D012C.buttonMap, factory profile); control identities and spots from VKB templates linked on https://vkbsimcontrollers.com/pages/downloads: STECS Mk1 & Mk2 v1.1 (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0808/7827/2731/files/VKB-STECS-v1.1.pdf, leader lines on the same photo angle) and STECS ATEM v1.0 (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0808/7827/2731/files/VKB-STECS-ATEM-v1.0.pdf)",
