  "note": "ATEM buttons and the aft triggers are placed on gallery-2 (pilot side view). The catalog has NO part for the OTS hat on this model (EDCD 012C lists no OTS push; RX/RY are the OTS axes) - the OTS 4-way (0.412 0.372) is therefore not marked. Catalog discrepancy: part throttle.ministick ('MB1 click') carries JOY_RX/JOY_RY, which EDCD 012C names 'OTS Vertical/Horizontal' (the catalog identify note also says RX/RY = OTS ministick), together with BTN34 = MB1. The part mixes two physical controls (OTS axes, MB1 push); kept as candidate on MB1. JOY_Z is 'Scoll Z' in EDCD; the only unlabelled wheel is the ribbed knob on the side of the thumb end face (template lists a 'Thumb' axis without a line) - candidate.",
